- U | put the gain into new drains for the low field that floods | land: U | v: security, achievement | lever: voice | foot: means money-.04 | chance: 70
- B | buy the field next door while the money is there | land: B | v: power, achievement | lever: voice | opens: land_dealing | foot: means money-.08 | chance: 60
- R | spend a good share of it on one wild night out in town, everyone invited | land: R | v: hedonism, stimulation | lever: neglect | foot: means money-.04 | chance: 75
- G | leave the last strip of the field standing for the birds and the hares | land: G | v: universalism, tradition | lever: loyalty | foot: lesson a little left over feeds many | chance: 85
- W>B | sell through the growers' co-operative at the agreed price, and bank the rest | land: W | v: conformity, security | lever: loyalty | foot: means money+.04 | chance: 75
- B>G | buy a few hardy old-breed sheep to graze the rough ground the old way | land: B | v: achievement, tradition | lever: fund | opens: keeping_animals | foot: place prod.land | chance: 65
- G>U | try the elders' old rotation on one field and measure what it does | land: G | v: tradition, self-direction | lever: found | opens: regen_farming | foot: person mentor | chance: 60
- U>R | spend it on a second-hand machine and teach yourself to fix it in the barn | land: U | v: self-direction, stimulation | lever: fund | foot: means money-.05 | chance: 55
- R>W | throw the barn open for a dance and invite the whole valley | land: R | v: stimulation, benevolence | lever: lead | foot: means ties+.05 | chance: 78
works: The good year carries the family through the winter with something to spare, and {parent} sleeps well for once.
works: Neighbours stop at the gate to say so, and {N} feels part of something that has been going on for a long time.
fails: The price drops at the market the same week, and the good year turns out merely ordinary.
fails: Half the gain is gone on repairs before anyone has decided what it was for.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- spring_return (cycle 1: W>U U>B B>R R>G G>W)

== the first warm day
tier: life event
land: spring_return
stages: juvenile young_adult adult mature elder
age: 12-90
per_year: 0 .25 .25 .25 .25 .25
tone: joy
life: nature, leisure
horizon: moment
roles: neighbour, friend, colleague
earth: the first warm day after winter, when the whole town seems to open its windows at once
tribal: the first warm day after the cold season, when the camp throws open every hide
magic: the first warm day after winter, when the tower's shutters open one by one
scene: The first warm day arrives without warning. {N} steps out and the air is soft, there is birdsong where there was none, and the whole street seems to have opened its windows at once.
scene W: The verges are full of the winter's litter, and {neighbour} is already out with a bag.
scene U: {N} could swear the swallows are back a week earlier than last year.
scene B: The market opens for the season on Saturday, and the stall has sat in the shed all winter.
scene R: The hills are right there, and everything else can wait.
scene G: The soil has gone from cold to crumbly overnight, and the seed packets are on the sill.
scene tribal: The first warm day comes, and the camp throws open every hide to the sun. {N} smells the earth thawing and the river running high.
scene magic: The tower's shutters open one by one on the first warm morning, and the courtyard fills with people blinking at the sun. Even the old keeper has come out.
