works: The warmth gets into {N} and stays all week, and winter feels like something that happened to someone else.
works: By evening {N} has sun on the face and soil under the nails, and is hopeful about everything.
fails: By afternoon the clouds are back and the cold with them, and the spring was only a rumour.
