works: {N} goes in at last with a stiff neck and a quiet head, and the stars are still there behind the eyes.
works: Somewhere in the hour on the grass a trouble shrinks to its proper size, and {N} sleeps well.
fails: Cloud rolls in within minutes, and the sky closes like a lid.
