- B | fill the basket to sell to the restaurants in town | land: B | v: achievement | lever: voice | foot: means money+.03 | chance: 65
- R | strip the best bush bare before anyone else gets to it | land: R | v: hedonism, stimulation | lever: subvert | foot: person rival | chance: 70
