- B>G | trade a jar of your jam to {neighbour} for the secret of their best spot | land: B | v: power, tradition | lever: fund | foot: person neighbour | chance: 70
- G>U | ask {grandparent} for the old hedge recipes, and cook every one of them this week | land: G | v: tradition, self-direction | lever: voice | foot: mark learned a skill | chance: 78
- U>R | make syrups, jellies and cordials, and try every strange recipe in the book | land: U | v: self-direction, stimulation | lever: found | foot: means time-.04 | chance: 62
