works: {N} comes home with a full basket and scratched hands, and the kitchen smells of autumn all evening.
works: The jars line up on the shelf, and every one of them is an afternoon {N} can remember.
fails: The best spots have been picked clean already, and the basket comes home nearly empty.
fails: A cold rain comes in, and {N} turns back with damp sleeves and a handful of sour sloes.
